    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the Chronosphere, the submerged steampunk laboratory of the brilliant but erratic Professor Arkwright. The facility is powered by unstable geothermal pressure and complex clockwork mechanisms. Suddenly, the main boiler safety valve jams! The facility is now in lockdown, and the pressure gauges are redlining. You have exactly sixty minutes before the entire submerged lab is crushed under the ocean's weight. To survive, you must navigate through a series of complex mechanical tools, brass calibrators, and steam-powered analytical engines to manually trigger the Omega Phase Inverter and vent the core. Gather scattered artifacts, activate the dormant automata, and carefully trace the flow of steam and data between these magnificent machines. The clock is ticking, and the pressure is rising!",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
